    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end. like i'm just holding onto a life that doesn't belong to me anymore. everything is so pointless now. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to not have to carry this weight anymore. do you think there's actually any point in trying to fix it?",
